  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Sw 101.05 Requests for Information. All oral and written requests for information concerning the duties and responsibilities of the commission, or requests for free copies of the commission's rules, shall be addressed to the lottery at the address and telephone number below:\n\nNew Hampshire Lottery Commission\n\n14 Integra Drive\n\nConcord, New Hampshire 03301\n\nTel: (603) 271-3391\n\nSource. #6509, eff 5-15-97",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/sw100.html"
